000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. BIGTAB.
000300* A table past 4096 elements and 64K of WORKING-STORAGE. Three
000400* things only break above those lines: the gap DS needs a length
000500* modifier over 65535, the literal subscript and the SEARCH ALL
000600* bound each need more than LA's 12-bit displacement.
000700 DATA DIVISION.
000800 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
000900 01  BIG-TABLE.
001000     05  BIG-ENTRY OCCURS 5000 TIMES
001100             ASCENDING KEY IS E-KEY
001200             INDEXED BY BX.
001300         10  E-KEY   PIC 9(5).
001400         10  E-TEXT  PIC X(15).
001500 01  TAIL-ITEM      PIC X(9) VALUE 'TAIL-HERE'.
001600 01  SUB            PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 0.
001700 01  SHOW           PIC 9(5).
001800 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
001900 A000-MAIN.
002000     PERFORM B010-FILL VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1
002100         UNTIL SUB > 5000.
002200     MOVE E-KEY (1) TO SHOW.
002300     DISPLAY 'FIRST ' SHOW.
002400     MOVE E-KEY (5000) TO SHOW.
002500     DISPLAY 'LAST  ' SHOW.
002600     SEARCH ALL BIG-ENTRY
002700         AT END
002800             DISPLAY 'NOTFOUND'
002900         WHEN E-KEY (BX) = 4321
003000             MOVE E-KEY (BX) TO SHOW
003100             DISPLAY 'FOUND ' SHOW.
003200     DISPLAY 'TAIL  ' TAIL-ITEM.
003300     STOP RUN.
003400 B010-FILL.
003500     MOVE SUB TO E-KEY (SUB).
003600     MOVE 'ROW' TO E-TEXT (SUB).
